      "label": "Who is it for?",
      "kind": "line",
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "id": "what-we-want-to-achieve",
      "label": "What should it achieve?",
      "kind": "line",
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "id": "research",
      "label": "Research notes to plan from:",
      "kind": "task",
      "required": false
    }
  ],
  "needs": [],
  "takes": {
    "from": [
      "marketing/a-monthly-trend-scan",
      "marketing/research-a-topic",
      "marketing/research-a-competitors-site"
    ],
    "ask": "research",
    "label": "Plan a month of content from this"
  },
  "text": "Plan the content for [month] for [channel] aimed at [who-it-is-for]. The main aim is [what-we-want-to-achieve]. Show me the plan first, with a subject and a day for each piece, and wait for my yes before writing anything. If I name research notes here, read them before you plan and use them as reference only: [research]",
